{"id":"n64680-1-9","stage":3,"title":"수돗물 · 自来水","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64680-1-9-1","ko":"아! 갑자기 욕실에 수돗물이 안 나와.","zh":"啊！浴室的自来水突然不流了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아!","meaning":"咦","explanation":"아：咦。","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"1","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子。","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"욕실에","meaning":"浴室","explanation":"욕실：浴室；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"욕실","audio":"/audio/ae6de37fe8809c8f7754.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67867","senseId":"1","lemma":"욕실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"욕실에","audio":"/audio/1bc9355229e596e41579.mp3"}},{"text":"수돗물이","meaning":"自来水","explanation":"수돗물：自来水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수돗물","audio":"/audio/2641434e91d270d61e9b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64680","senseId":"1","lemma":"수돗물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수돗물이","audio":"/audio/9a289d2477bb919202a1.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"나와.","meaning":"流出，漏出，涌出","explanation":"나오다：流出，漏出，涌出；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"9","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Kor